[
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[happy] Hello and welcome to English Podcast from TTB Learning English. I'm Tracy.",
        "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[happy] And I'm Brian. Welcome back, everyone.",
        "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[excited] Today we're talking about something very modern... vibe coding.",
        "emotion": "excited"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[curious] Ah yes... the internet's newest obsession.",
        "emotion": "curious"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[neutral] Some people think vibe coding is brilliant.",
        "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[disappointed] And some people think it's the end of proper programming.",
        "emotion": "disappointed"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[happy] So today we're asking... is vibe coding actually useful?",
        "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[curious] Or is it just another trendy buzzword?",
        "emotion": "curious"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[neutral] We'll also teach you some useful vocabulary related to technology and creativity.",
        "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[happy] And of course... we'll have a quiz question for you.",
        "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[curious] Right then, Brian... do you actually know what vibe coding means?",
        "emotion": "curious"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[nervous] Um... kind of? I mean... I think so.",
        "emotion": "nervous"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[happy] That's not very confident.",
        "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[neutral] Well... honestly... nobody seems fully confident about it.",
        "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[excited] Fair point.",
        "emotion": "excited"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[neutral] The phrase usually describes coding in a relaxed, creative, almost playful way.",
        "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[curious] Like coding based on feelings and experimentation instead of strict planning?",
