        "text": "[neutral] B. JavaScript.",
        "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[neutral] Or C. C plus plus.",
        "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[happy] We'll reveal the answer later in the programme.",
        "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[neutral] Right. So Tracy... have you ever tried vibe coding?",
        "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[curious] Honestly... maybe without realising it.",
