        "text": "[neutral] Yes. Traditionally they plan everything carefully.",
        "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[neutral] They design systems, write documentation, test code... all very organised.",
        "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[excited] Whereas vibe coding sounds more like... improvisation.",
        "emotion": "excited"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[happy] Like jazz music.",
        "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
