    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[disappointed] Exactly.",
        "emotion": "disappointed"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[neutral] So vibe coding can feel fast at first.",
        "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[neutral] But fixing problems later may take even longer.",
        "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[impressed] That's actually an important point.",
        "emotion": "impressed"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[curious] Still... many young developers love the idea.",
        "emotion": "curious"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[neutral] Especially beginners.",
        "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[curious] Why do you think that is?",
        "emotion": "curious"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[neutral] Because traditional coding can feel intimidating.",
        "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
