    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[nervous] Honestly... it can feel overwhelming.",
        "emotion": "nervous"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Tracy",
        "text": "[neutral] Whereas vibe coding feels more relaxed.",
        "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[happy] Yes. More playful.",
