    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[neutral] Well... imagine building software for a hospital.",
        "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
        "speaker": "Brian",
        "text": "[nervous] You probably don't want doctors saying... um... let's just vibe code this surgery system.",
